{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1272,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85df422726d60610c73c79f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天你也会用最棒的\r\n训练内容款待我吧？\r\n随、随口说说的啦……耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3916838d910818a39a8718ba8cb43cc0aa58745fe62c347e3caab23a522ace94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa53346af4b8e11f94f0aca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我想再把自己逼得更紧一点！\r\n别担心！我带了自己亲手做的\r\n巧克力棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ead3cec76ebbfe49da4a64234d3382b881f0029a0a9b37b275fe82ea0418dda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89340102d76cb45bf6b6fb28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想跑出好表现，\r\n希望能藉此为训练员带来勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff1c866197a491b6600bb96ec055450cc8a583c08c92d575ff270fc58c8577c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3183fc49c397a08985a57b02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要好好完成训练项目，\r\n然后用最棒的胜利来\r\n「款待」训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d371a2d36d6ede8f3c571d848afd022593d2d98c07323ebf3b989e7750dd685",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cb0c176627ba3e2a9a0b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……\r\n总是会帮助我鼓起勇气，\r\n对我来说是非常重要的人之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c295f62203bacde628e06e468dd80f6c377b4f9de1c3432a147fd663be885543",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:506bd8b8b489ec004db89fe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得和训练员一起，就一定能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5ee5b2ce86dc8531d3409e2e6e4d39e1bf06146f22982d995ea4dfea0dd08c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e430cfcdee7fc7ca76c2a933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不会白费我们一起努力的结晶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "641c1253459f1c45085c6cc6b590504653bbbb783d20ce3389f55410ef031867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8fae2cfeef25c6e4c88229e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否带给了你\r\n足以实现梦想的勇气呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a2891058d1db8c883350d88c0f6505e434a576ab6e2bbf7c758e1bb45f8bd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119564936d1bf3cf10995e88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我的表现还满意吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d335fee55b7f44b504582f4ff9cfa04bcc2539efda5991fc157d9f962fb7a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92534f422838522078389c59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！肌肉正在嘶吼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a3dd85f7e939dc729c18ec57ac11cd4a898ad181a00f71c5d2cc3097d29c319",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9dcc34aefb144cd2403ffa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肌肉的成长没有极限！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30dc042c52191e22ae6d2a39b4c0471f2185132d13ef51ef246565b4d9fad91c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6f1e853c246e368a02a726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我是目白赖恩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9589c4157b71a743f94adb9cffe35e2dd30342c8fa76fa55071773a8278802a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64300ca3bc222844948d6c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能帮上更多忙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82497f3a114c4ea74dc41756535fa9183450a276c2b3e052d7c32e81fbb0237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff50cbaaf564c475e02d8f46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb361514687f96b7e8ce19c0c8fa4564242ad0839f18d4f68d81df9c59820d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab96b1a4845088a60d1ff7c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是不是变得更接近\r\n理想中的大人了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd73c31c7864d20f2f9339599ac062c5560e6a9ec6fb8d448dc1e1a67261312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4966515ea5786a71027c0279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天我一定要成为\r\n精明干练的店长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce06ed5996998fae2f57fcee8622c392442ebe10c9325e7d6f451c7f3513f64c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3090e6378771b2c01372f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这杯是能鼓舞心灵的全力之作。\r\n敬请慢慢享用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "316802fbc9a020ce8c78e2236071bdfdde639d45285b75fa60f99764203e9eb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfd26e685b32a20151d9648",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临，我是目白赖恩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a325658eb0895c1ff65cc02443ef5048360b8068db289dadc14b69b869de9647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b08273066ac094702bd2175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽全力上吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a72bb166c714094d65a64f5d9b155332aa9d4e3fe273dd99590a8df24d54d683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3ea37e2bfb4498939f54c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练跟竞赛以及料理……\r\n全～部都一起加油吧～\r\n目标是做出最棒的「相扑火锅」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "734a614cf7bdcebd09fb35b1e61452628a77791c230081194bee9bc882b3da10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd54861535982b1b1b970d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c72dfae705efcef65bc49b38a341c58d191b306f83675cb9c5b9126795dcaea6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13bcf5e72bc1c877216b454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d18f79da33c356a433357d86ef63d6f12d0393bf7a401aa168fbc536b2b3d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23aa53e77ae39f18f608cd85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为「真正的相扑火锅」，\r\n有好多东西不可或缺，\r\n不过最重要就是训练员了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e4be80820a036f7700b5aed2e2b3d46c06f49c4ee5bea55989929ebd8ad811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4a72bd8f5a6acc6452ed8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员和大家准备的\r\nbuono的好料，\r\n我永远永远都不会忘记喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7345642feaa40dfe4e853bd9b1ffa8ceee0efba281208ee07559613a50daef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7699577cb982d7dce83444",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐～\r\n我会在中央广场捣年糕，\r\n训练员也一起来吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "430a90da55e2a9aaf0a932bacb83b2530113e3a3b3db0879a8178f17427a7690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b46c206f90290874c158d7d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了buono的特制巧克力喔～\r\n呵呵，因为我想看见训练员\r\n开心的表情嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b79540aafa034d4dffab55bc62a7fc3508f745608b75f4936054d867cdf87080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf6862cb8ade80107802f30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我烤了特大巧克力蛋糕～！\r\n因为我想跟训练员分享\r\n自己超级buono的心情～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c56aa3846777dcf2ca7686c64f5b1397d9e77ec8c78be7d6bf01ba957162541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee673b32733f4ffb0f0f9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的愿望啊～\r\n就是希望大家能幸福，\r\n可以做出美味料理☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "170b156fafe6c947ddf4d7abd17731e704420792c12cee28e3b1c0dda3ce4860",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef8ace891363acd69c459f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从甜甜的到成熟口味的点心，\r\n我都准备了很多喔～\r\n没吃完就大家一起开点心派对吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d09d85d3798ddc8d57c4be7d715ab07ddca10ec2b076fcc91bbfb32115d0cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2589a71d46849f40512dbea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火鸡是要大家齐聚一堂\r\n一起吃的餐点～实质上就是火锅☆\r\n我会拿出干劲制作喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9235876b8bb387696291b2dd9ae9c329c4a19a184036bd42e1694a8d29689f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:688adf29d80e2d5d89533114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好开心好开心的圣诞节～☆\r\n我要送训练员一套buono的\r\n幸福全餐当礼物喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd98532d0c44bf347008842a323a981839acf2830c538c2d1993d3323288ab1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:685776b1f918fb52d58b5022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Buono buono！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6cb3cf509ce23bd2e83249b0d6e2fcadca7b86e6aea4d60348e0bbee1bc3aae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa3fd0cd7825a65fb4f96ffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也辛苦你咯～\r\n在除夕吃些好料，\r\n带着笑容迎接新年吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2810f819638ee9c08399b377030b0e28cc6b285af0b84f302bbdee80c7bcfd45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0727956c6304c20e1add7246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐～！\r\n一年一度的大型活动，\r\n得盛大庆祝才行呢～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2e561f038f2e0a5e80a09315995b77881b8fabf33596d32a1efaf3a4edfd6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:406034c4f102a4cdd9208cf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了个很大的生日蛋糕喔～！\r\n把大家找来，开始训练员的\r\n快乐庆生会吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "692c61f74095cde448c6186239ea065f0d07767abb5c2f9a45e6e59f97d8cc9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fc4ec4fd7d2b495b0939bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凡事都是越大越好喔～☆\r\n所以～我的庆生会，\r\n要招待大～家一起来～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c64716416686e642032cded19f0d999032f5199db1b3358b22603ca3ce392d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e0eb59af371e19cf0581e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物啊～嗯。\r\n应该是希望能让训练员吃到\r\n我的最新料理吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "18eeedad55cb658fe0e1d9f82e3419baf3699a3e3a8f6a325dd7951c6a4b092a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86af646b7e4914a87e515d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告耶。\r\n我也很好奇啊～\r\n一起打开看看吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "af3db9a5a4d56973896589cfb19829e19889aa754404aa355a4fc986e4f32598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:988dd99563e3773d236a485d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了喔。\r\n里面或许放了很buono的东西～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d6234b7a7117d0b8fa3096ebcee01fce87337ba3ff6b088c6c833e79feb267b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54409c46bfaade72efc30ce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务，太好了呢～☆\r\n努力之后的奖赏……\r\n这也是「相扑火锅」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ae7e23fb19f0137bddb37dcb0100a8724b405b623e58de5356dc6a2903bb83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0654daf7280ca01514e20f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动喔。\r\n我来为聚集起来的大家\r\n制作美味料理吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd0e3018c856f0154598d7e67ad2828a565e8ddc92b4d846fe8ea714503b011f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e859d5af4b0e5356e7f98cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动气氛很热烈呢～\r\n我们也去吧～！\r\n努力过后吃饭也特别buono喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8dba3f4091ba9d3f7f8c53964572cd1a9e54ae6c4c0606438f41999fc41a358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84546fde51a604b3d8bfda8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定会赢喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb0efef29f71b90eb83af77d38d88fc3e9200262d2888e8fb9b08b0ca8923e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
